{"3882900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "No Space For Salad", "steam_appid": 3882900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/b2e9fbda11144ec6edbb8ae1eceaf67a.avif?t=1781016421\" width=1226 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Space For Salad is a cozy exploration and cooking game playable solo or in local co-op.<br>After joining a suspicious galactic restaurant franchise, two friends end up stranded in a forgotten nebula with a mountain of debt and a very talkative admin AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/9eaccd131583d59fbe80d20b1553ed87.avif?t=1781016421\" width=1226 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/b99f1b4517fdfdfa70291fcaed206ec1.poster.avif?t=1781016421\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/b99f1b4517fdfdfa70291fcaed206ec1.webm?t=1781016421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/b99f1b4517fdfdfa70291fcaed206ec1.mp4?t=1781016421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your food truck doors in orbit and cook for customers from every corner of the galaxy. Take your time — they're in no rush. Experiment with countless recipes and find your signature dish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/2ce42dad45d30292a2b0dcd66dd27a1b.avif?t=1781016421\" width=1226 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/c7461b21bf6f3a623dd09bdfd773c167.poster.avif?t=1781016421\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/c7461b21bf6f3a623dd09bdfd773c167.webm?t=1781016421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/c7461b21bf6f3a623dd09bdfd773c167.mp4?t=1781016421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your space, add tables and chairs, decorate to your taste. You can even redecorate while customers are eating — that's how patient they are.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/3b4e3db8b1f47cc982a60fa391d29677.avif?t=1781016421\" width=1226 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/08d9882ac7b430027bb325f50f1e73ab.poster.avif?t=1781016421\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/08d9882ac7b430027bb325f50f1e73ab.webm?t=1781016421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/08d9882ac7b430027bb325f50f1e73ab.mp4?t=1781016421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump in your shuttle and fly to any unknown planet of your choice. Every world is different, every landing is a new adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/ad41238fe7eb7abf3355a726d080be04.avif?t=1781016421\" width=1226 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/603fb435dc841be407d9e519a0639fd0.poster.avif?t=1781016421\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/603fb435dc841be407d9e519a0639fd0.webm?t=1781016421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/603fb435dc841be407d9e519a0639fd0.mp4?t=1781016421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vacuum up every fruit, vegetable and strange thing you find with your trusty space hoover. Who knows what might end up in your next recipe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/66db17c098308caa04bda9c8327ef6c3.avif?t=1781016421\" width=1226 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/e704b7e062126467579912fb548e0e89.poster.avif?t=1781016421\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/e704b7e062126467579912fb548e0e89.webm?t=1781016421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/e704b7e062126467579912fb548e0e89.mp4?t=1781016421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up your own little base — melt down materials, build oxygen domes, ovens, extractors and more. Make every planet feel like home.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/b2e9fbda11144ec6edbb8ae1eceaf67a.avif?t=1781016421\" width=1226 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Space For Salad is a cozy exploration and cooking game playable solo or in local co-op.<br>After joining a suspicious galactic restaurant franchise, two friends end up stranded in a forgotten nebula with a mountain of debt and a very talkative admin AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/9eaccd131583d59fbe80d20b1553ed87.avif?t=1781016421\" width=1226 height=130 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/b99f1b4517fdfdfa70291fcaed206ec1.poster.avif?t=1781016421\" width=1170 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/b99f1b4517fdfdfa70291fcaed206ec1.webm?t=1781016421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882900/extras/b99f1b4517fdfdfa70291fcaed206ec1.mp4?t=1781016421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your food truck doors in orbit and cook for customers from every corner of the galaxy. Take your time — they're in no rush. Experiment with countless recipes and find your signature dish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_im